<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94931" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκῖρον</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκίρον</span></b> , τό, a suburb of Athens,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀθηναῖοι τρεῖς ἀρότους
			ἱερ&lt;&gt;ὺς ἄγουσι, πρῶτον ἐπὶ Σκίρῳ</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Plu.
			2.144a
		</span></i>; named after the seer <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκ&lt;&gt;<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οος</span></span>,
			<i><span class="en">
			Paus.
			1.36.4
		</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκειρόμαντις; ἐπὶ Σκίρῳ
					ἱεροποιία</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				9.1.9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκύβευον ἐπὶ Σκίρῳ ἐν τῷ τῆς
					Σκιράδος Ἀθηνᾶς νεῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					9.96
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1397.25
			</span></i>; a district of brothels and the like , <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.8
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				St.Byz.
			</span></i>; cf. foreg.</div>
